{"4164530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "INTERSTELLAR EMPIRE《星际帝国》", "steam_appid": 4164530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/3a640ccec3cc14fc26692a574eb8b3d7.avif?t=1766908099\" width=900 height=250 /></span><strong>A civilization born. An eternal journey begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the cosmos, the first flame pierced the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will witness everything—from the first strike of stone against stone, to the roar of starship engines tearing through the void. Time unfolds before you. Civilization takes shape in your hands. This is not mere evolution. This is <strong>creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See your world through any lens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warrior's eye. The commander's gaze. The creator's vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge through fire and smoke. Contemplate before star charts. Hover above clouds, watching your empire's heartbeat pulse below. Every perspective reveals a truth. Every shift is a rebirth. You are not simply an observer. You <strong>are</strong> this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless legions, infinite possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources flow. Armies rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No boundaries. No ceiling. Your will determines fleet size. Your wisdom defines the shape of war. Will steel torrents drown entire systems? Or will elite forces slice through the void like surgical strikes? The answer exists only in your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Value flows between players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currency is more than numbers. Trade is more than mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every exchange between conquerors carries real weight. Your empire doesn't merely exist on screen—its value flows, grows, and endures within the economic network woven by players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From dust we rise. Toward stars we reach.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Gameplay Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Empire</i> is a cross-era civilization building + real-time strategy game with core gameplay including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilization Evolution System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the Stone Age and progressively unlock the tech tree<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/2312faa040c5d5812e8bbd3f06af7fd1.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple eras: Primitive, Classical, Industrial, Space, and beyond<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/5f1d25c563c61acefeb687ef42669c41.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each era features unique units, buildings, and tactics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/079b6eef4c756bb65bcd707e41d8abd9.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Body + Possession Perspective System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have a fixed ruler main body identity<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/a08ad33c1479dcfaf1247372c747034c.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1424 height=832 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can &quot;possess&quot; any unit to control them in first/third-person view<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/660e31f58632da0c219219c054936204.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can also switch back to god's-eye view for macro-level command<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/b6987f7e4d596971e5f7310f41fe4383.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Essentially the same you, just different perception modes<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/6e73b5eeb081fc2aa5eee11a5bc8fa91.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Legion Mechanism</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaks through traditional RTS population limits<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/f8489bfd900198db869178e91ae07189.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unlimited units as long as resources are sufficient<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/5a76a37bc3a4bd216d48c1842b7b337b.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports massive battles with thousands of units on screen simultaneously</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Economy System</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/a669f549704341236e9a0fe4dfe4230f.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every inch of territory you conquer has permanent ownership<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/e30d28e7c9a07909ec5190bc7fa7e5d6.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources, equipment, and land can be freely priced and traded with global players<strong>Game Gameplay Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map that has been completed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/de7051c0d4e19e9e6af93932b522eb5e.avif?t=1766908099\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras_big/de7051c0d4e19e9e6af93932b522eb5e.avif?t=1766908099 width=1560 height=942 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game originated from a 15-year-old entrepreneur.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/3a640ccec3cc14fc26692a574eb8b3d7.avif?t=1766908099\" width=900 height=250 /></span><strong>A civilization born. An eternal journey begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in the cosmos, the first flame pierced the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will witness everything—from the first strike of stone against stone, to the roar of starship engines tearing through the void. Time unfolds before you. Civilization takes shape in your hands. This is not mere evolution. This is <strong>creation</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>See your world through any lens</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warrior's eye. The commander's gaze. The creator's vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge through fire and smoke. Contemplate before star charts. Hover above clouds, watching your empire's heartbeat pulse below. Every perspective reveals a truth. Every shift is a rebirth. You are not simply an observer. You <strong>are</strong> this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless legions, infinite possibilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources flow. Armies rise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No boundaries. No ceiling. Your will determines fleet size. Your wisdom defines the shape of war. Will steel torrents drown entire systems? Or will elite forces slice through the void like surgical strikes? The answer exists only in your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Value flows between players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currency is more than numbers. Trade is more than mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, every exchange between conquerors carries real weight. Your empire doesn't merely exist on screen—its value flows, grows, and endures within the economic network woven by players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From dust we rise. Toward stars we reach.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Gameplay Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stellar Empire</i> is a cross-era civilization building + real-time strategy game with core gameplay including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Civilization Evolution System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from the Stone Age and progressively unlock the tech tree<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/2312faa040c5d5812e8bbd3f06af7fd1.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiple eras: Primitive, Classical, Industrial, Space, and beyond<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/5f1d25c563c61acefeb687ef42669c41.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each era features unique units, buildings, and tactics<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/079b6eef4c756bb65bcd707e41d8abd9.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Body + Possession Perspective System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have a fixed ruler main body identity<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/a08ad33c1479dcfaf1247372c747034c.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1424 height=832 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can &quot;possess&quot; any unit to control them in first/third-person view<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/660e31f58632da0c219219c054936204.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can also switch back to god's-eye view for macro-level command<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/b6987f7e4d596971e5f7310f41fe4383.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Essentially the same you, just different perception modes<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/6e73b5eeb081fc2aa5eee11a5bc8fa91.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite Legion Mechanism</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaks through traditional RTS population limits<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/f8489bfd900198db869178e91ae07189.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unlimited units as long as resources are sufficient<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/5a76a37bc3a4bd216d48c1842b7b337b.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports massive battles with thousands of units on screen simultaneously</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Economy System</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/a669f549704341236e9a0fe4dfe4230f.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every inch of territory you conquer has permanent ownership<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/e30d28e7c9a07909ec5190bc7fa7e5d6.avif?t=1766908099\" width=1456 height=816 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources, equipment, and land can be freely priced and traded with global players<strong>Game Gameplay Description</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map that has been completed.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras/de7051c0d4e19e9e6af93932b522eb5e.avif?t=1766908099\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164530/extras_big/de7051c0d4e19e9e6af93932b522eb5e.avif?t=1766908099 width=1560 height=942 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game originated from a 15-year-old entrepreneur.</p>", "shor